flowchart TB
    subgraph PricingSide[Pricing Side]
        ORCH[Price Change Orchestrator]
        OUTBOX[(Publication Outbox)]
        OPUB[Outbox Publisher]
    end

    subgraph EventBackbone[Event Backbone]
        KAFKA[Kafka / Event Backbone]
    end

    subgraph PublicationSide[Publication and Integration Service]
        CONSUMER[Price Publication Consumer]
        TRACKER[(Delivery Tracker)]
        RECON[Reconciliation Worker]
        CMSAD[CMS Adapter]
        BREAKER[Circuit Breaker]
        RETRY[Retry Policy]
    end

    CMS[Channel Management System]

    ORCH -->|create durable publication intent| OUTBOX
    OPUB -->|read pending entries| OUTBOX
    OPUB -->|retry publish| KAFKA
    KAFKA -->|deliver event| CONSUMER

    CONSUMER -->|record CONSUMER_RECEIVED| TRACKER
    CONSUMER --> CMSAD
    CMSAD --> RETRY
    RETRY --> BREAKER
    BREAKER -->|REST call| CMS

    CMSAD -->|record send/ack/failure| TRACKER
    RECON -->|detect gaps/stuck work| OUTBOX
    RECON -->|compare/repair lifecycle| TRACKER
    RECON -->|re-drive publication| KAFKA